ヒカリへと 放してごらん
Try releasing them toward the light.

10
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,600
虹を結んで空のリボン
A ribbon in the sky connecting rainbows,

11
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,800
君の笑顔へ贈り物よ
A gift for your smile.

12
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:05,100
願いをかけましょう夢日和
Let's make a wish on this dream-weather day,

13
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:09,100
明日また しあわせで あるように
Hoping tomorrow will be happy once again.

14
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:11,200
雲の綿菓子摘まれては
Picking cotton candy from the clouds,

15
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,100
ひと休みの草原
A resting place in the meadow.

16
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:15,500
「風はどこへ 帰っていくの?」
"Where does the wind go back to?"

17
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,400
鳥に 尋ねましょう
Let's ask the birds.

18
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,500
夕日のレース肩にかけて
With the lace of the sunset on our shoulders,

19
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,500
伸びている影と駆けっこ
Playing tag with our stretching shadows.

20
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,200
「見守ってるずっと...」光る宵月の
"I'll always watch over you..." The shining moon,

21
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,400
優しさに 包まれてごらん
Enveloping us in its tenderness.

22
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,600
星を並べて空のボタン
Lining up stars like buttons in the sky,

23
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,700
夜のカーテンを留めてあげる
Fastening the curtain of night.

24
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:33,900
明日も逢えるよ夢日和
We can meet tomorrow too, on this dream-weather day,

25
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:36,500
その笑顔 忘れてい ないなら
If you haven't forgotten that smile.

26
