"I'm no good, but why is he fine?"

86
00:05:09,119 --> 00:05:10,979
そこに壁が あっただけなのに
Even though there was just a wall there,

87
00:05:10,979 --> 00:05:12,789
生まれてしまった 運命嘆くな
I was born—don't lament fate.

88
00:05:12,789 --> 00:05:15,539
僕らはみんな 自由なんだから
Because we are all free.

89
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:22,089
