152
00:12:48,016 --> 00:12:54,516
等身大の私を映していたい
I want to reflect my true self as I am.

153
00:12:54,516 --> 00:12:58,216
ただ望む瞬間衝動になってんだ
It just became an instantaneous impulse of desire.

154
00:12:58,216 --> 00:13:02,016
「くだらない」とか
Stuff like "how pointless"

155
00:13:02,016 --> 00:13:06,016
曇りきってきた目を拭いて
wiping away my clouded eyes,

156
00:13:06,016 --> 00:13:11,816
可能性だって夢を見てみたいのに
even though I want to dream of possibilities.

157
00:13:11,816 --> 00:13:16,816
ずっとわかっていたんだけれど
I've known it all along,

158
00:13:16,816 --> 00:13:22,016
言葉は打ってる 対象に
but the words are aimed at the target.

159
